{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22374","headline":"溪中早春 · 白居易","name":"溪中早春","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"南山雪未尽，阴岭留残白。\n西涧冰已消，春溜含新碧。\n东风来几日，蛰动萌草坼。\n潜知阳和功，一日不虚掷。\n爱此天气暖，来拂溪边石。\n一坐欲忘归，暮禽声啧啧。\n蓬蒿隔桑枣，隐映烟火夕。\n归来问夜餐，家人烹荠麦。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22374.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22374","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}